            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_strike\">This weeks</span> The world's best mass llama-slaughter roguelike-lite-ish couch co-op top-down twin-stick shooter.<br><br>VALA is a frantic top-down shooter where you remotely pilot an endless supply of mechs from your ocean carrier offshore of the apocalypse, fighting through the llama hordes to take down The Llamanati.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>1 to 4 player local couch-co-op<br></li><li>A massive, changing city to explore<br></li><li>Every playthrough is unique<br></li><li>Campaign and endless modes<br></li><li>Full controller and keyboard/mouse support<br></li><li>Dozens of weapons to unlock<br></li><li>A plethora of perks to unlock<br></li><li>Hundreds of bad puns, narrated for your pleasure<br></li><li>A fancy switch to turn off blood &amp; gore<br></li><li>No in-game loading time, ever</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How the game works</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Start each playthrough with a stock mech and guns - pray that Llamazon blesses you!<br></li><li>Weapons and perks that you've unlocked can get dropped in by Llamazon drones<br></li><li>There are no &quot;health packs&quot; - do you think this is some sort of game?!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An awesome foursome</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659110/extras/b3adc03afb2f07b5592848e2f5d0b9a2.poster.avif?t=1666988842\" width=462 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659110/extras/b3adc03afb2f07b5592848e2f5d0b9a2.webm?t=1666988842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659110/extras/b3adc03afb2f07b5592848e2f5d0b9a2.mp4?t=1666988842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Physics gone-wild</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\